<title>UK: Hong Kong June air cargo traffic by region detaile.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong June air cargo traffic by region detaile.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong civil aviation department statistics show cargo handled in June totalled by region rose 5.3 percent against the same period last year. Imports reached 62,097 tonnes and 62,870 tonnes for exports -- this included scheduled and non-schedule flights.</p>
<p>Regional figures (rounded)in tonnes are shown in the table below.</p>
<p>			  JUNE 1996 - ALL FLIGHTS</p>
<p>			    UNLOADED    LOADED	   PCT CHANGE FROM</p>
<p>JUNE</p>
<p>								 1995  FOR ALL</p>
<p>CARGO</p>
