<p>ASIA OTHERS	     4,137.0     4,571.3	  6.0</p>
<p>AUSTRALIA		 3,695.0     2,314.0	 -0.2</p>
<p>CONTINENTAL EUROPE    9,979.0     7,952.0	  6.9</p>
<p>JAPAN		     5,938.5     9,537.8	 -5.0</p>
<p>MAINLAND CHINA	  1,682.0     2,753.0	  8.6</p>
<p>MIDDLE EAST		 852.0     1,293.0	  1.9</p>
<p>S.E.ASIA		 16,587.6     9,574.2	  4.4</p>
<p>S.AMERICA		    98.4	  51.6	-23.0</p>
